 x.find('narrator-a')['text']=T('My public approval was for preview PA1, text A1. A2 adds Cleo’s uncut clinic passage F. I can approve my own words, not widen her quote licence. A2 can go in the planning prep if her terms allow it. For public audio, the Mill player only; no online download. Please send me the final public stop text.|我公开同意的是预览PA1里的A1文字。A2加了Cleo未删节的诊所段F，我能同意自己的话，不能扩大她的引语许可。若她的条款允许，A2可进策划准备稿。音频只准磨坊现场播，不上网下载。公开站点最终文字发我。')
