 x.find('narrator-b')['text']=T('When I wrote “go ahead”, I was replying to preview PB1, not the newer editor tab. PB1 contains B1. B2 is the uncut planning version with Cleo’s passage, not a new public approval. The edited B1 recording may play at the Bridge stop only, without downloads. Keep my public name Bo and leave the workplace out of public material. Send my final public text here.|我说“发吧”回复的是PB1预览，不是较新的编辑器页；PB1里是B1。B2是带Cleo那段话的完整策划版，不是新增公开许可。剪辑B1录音只准桥边站点播，不下载。公开用Bo这个名字，单位别放公开材料，最终公开文字发本串。')
